  "implementation": [
    "Dispatch colocated PP DSPARK to a synchronous loop that relays requests before handlers/collectives, uses ordinary batch planning and result processing, and coordinates idle turns.",
    "Mirror active PP batch slots for cancellation and idle checks; broadcast expired request IDs selected by world rank zero.",
    "Execute DSparkPPCoordinator under scheduler forward isolation and retain local capture tickets and common next-draft state.",
    "Allow static target-KV PP serving with DP1/CP1 and device KV cache. Reject PP disaggregation, hidden-input drafts, confidence verify, overlap, HiCache, LMCache and FlexKV.",
    "Allocate PP hidden/residual graph buffers by verify-token capacity, slice output to actual token count and refresh predecessor activations after early verify planning.",
    "Normalize production array.array request tokens before signature hashing and reject activation frames with incorrect token counts before transport.",
    "Reuse distributed owner-local snapshot writing and Catalog cohort publication; no Mooncake API or training tensor schema changes."
  ],
